    "file": "src/sprite/store.rs",
    "line": 157,
    "summary": "The summary line says 'replace the destination', but write_atomic is also used to create files that don't exist yet.",
    "failure_scenario": "example::write_example and the regions batch save write fresh paths through write_atomic. A reader of the doc may think a missing destination is an error, or reach for publish_new instead, which refuses existing names."
  },
