    "file": "src/sprite/store.rs",
    "line": 159,
    "summary": "Separating 'content synced with sync_all' from 'name not durable' implies the content is durable, which isn't true on memory-backed filesystems (tmpfs, Emscripten MEMFS) that 8q9 lists as having no persistence.",
